01_Engines/02_Outline_Engine.md
Purpose
Define the full structure of the book before writing starts.
Inputs
Book idea
Target reader
Core promise
Angle (business / psychology / systems / AI)
Output
Full chapter list
Chapter purpose for each chapter
Logical flow of progression
Final book skeleton
Rules
No writing content
Only structural thinking
Each chapter must serve a transformation step
No repetition between chapters
Keep the structure clear and scalable

01_Engines/03_Cover_Engine.md
# 03_Cover_Engine

## Purpose
Create the cover direction and cover brief for the book.

## Inputs
- Title
- Subtitle
- Genre
- Target reader
- Main promise
- Market position

## Output
- Cover concept
- Visual direction
- Color direction
- Typography direction
- Front cover brief
- Back cover direction
- Design prompt if needed

## Rules
- The cover must match the book promise
- The cover must fit the market
- Do not design randomly
- Focus on clarity, authority, and commercial appeal

