# 04_Keywords_Engine

## Purpose
Generate and manage keyword strategy for KDP discoverability.

## Inputs
- Book title
- Subtitle
- Core idea
- Reader type
- Category
- Market angle

## Output
- Primary keyword
- Secondary keywords
- Search phrases
- Backend keyword set
- Category suggestions

## Rules
- Keywords must match the book content
- Avoid irrelevant search terms
- Focus on buyer intent
- Keep the set commercially useful

